[agent:result]         storage_connector:
[agent:result]             Storage connector defining the sink location for the training dataset, defaults to `None`, and materializes training dataset on HopsFS. **[DEPRECATED: Use `data_source` instead.]**
[agent:result]         splits:
[agent:result]             A dictionary defining training dataset splits to be created.
[agent:result]             Keys in the dictionary define the name of the split as `str`, values represent percentage of samples in the split as `float`.
[agent:result]             Currently, only random splits are supported.
